{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36263","headline":"归睦州中路寄侯郎中 · 方干","name":"归睦州中路寄侯郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"颜巷萧条知命後，膺门感激受恩初。\n却容鹤髪还蜗舍，犹梦渔竿从隼旟。\n新定暮云吞故国，会稽春草入贫居。\n乡中自古爲儒者，谁得公侯降尺书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}